			<div class="content" id="post-content-1912760">
									

<p>Not really a fan of this. Recruiting people who have this little idea what they're getting into is a very bad idea. It'll result in crippling morale and personnel problems, which the Foundation absolutely cannot afford. What are they offering this guy, exactly? Money he can't spend because he'll be vanished from the regular world? Not only is that a very, very good way to have open rebellion among your staff, but it's also very visible. Think people wouldn't notice that huge numbers of the best and brightest go missing?</p>
